- `dotnet build NutriExercise.sln` → 0 warnings / 0 errors.
- `dotnet test NutriExercise.sln` → Specs **15/15**, Tests **14/14**.
- Runtime smoke test (`dotnet run --urls http://127.0.0.1:5039`):
